; An-24 Bridge — WASM system for per-frame SimVars polling.
; Runs every frame in the background, driving the CommBus protocol.
; Alternative to panel.cfg gauge registration — a system does not
; consume VRAM or require a texture slot.
;
; When using systems.cfg, place the .wasm file in the wasm/ folder
; alongside this file within the SimObject package.
;
; Both panel.cfg and systems.cfg can reference the same module.
; Use panel.cfg if you also need visual gauge callbacks; use
; systems.cfg for pure background data bridge operations.

[WASM_SYSTEM.0]
ModulePath=an24_bridge
SystemName=an24_bridge
ParameterString=""
